<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sentrachem shares slide on profit warning.</title>
<headline>Sentrachem shares slide on profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in South African chemical company Sentrachem Ltd slid almost seven percent within minutes of the opening of trade on Thursday following a profit warning earlier, dealers said.</p>
<p>Shares plumbed their lowest level this year falling to 11.50 rand after the company said losses in its Sanachem subsidiary would impact substantially on group profitability in the 1997 financial year.  </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
